      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T08:59:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is more flexible for us to no matter simplify what a function did or unit test.\n\n\nAs one function is only for parsing file by `XSDC` and use a predefined class `LeAudioOffloadSetting` to store it.\n\nThe other function is for writing into our container, e.g., private map or codec capabilities cache `leAudioCodecCapabilities`.\n\nAnd for unit test, we are able to create test cases for `LeAudioOffloadSetting` and check if our `GetLeAudioCodecCapabilities` works correctly as this function is implemented by us and the core of first function is implemented by `XSDC`. Therefore, \n1. simplify and not make function too complicate\n2. unit test the second function \nAbove two points are my veiwpoints to split function into two functions.\n\nAre there any suggestions about this approach?",
      "parentUuid": "44d5e1a5_1ea322bf",
      "revId": "e5a172296ef7fe45466bacb12b7b1a5782e6381a",
