      "message": "If we call `ParseFromLeAduioOffloadSettingFile()` with `GetLeAudioCodecCapabilities()` together, then we would not enter this condition.\n\nIn `bluetooth/audio/utils/aidl_session/BluetoothLeAudioCodecs.cpp`, we do check this by \n```\nif (kDefaultOffloadLeAudioCapabilities.empty()) {...}\n```\n\n\nHowever, use this condition to prevent developers from not checking capabilities outside of the class `BluetoothLeAudioCodecsProvider` if they also have a tmp container to cache capabilities.",
